# The cases of named_host.anti: a name and the value of ANTI_FAULT, see
# tests/CMakeLists.txt. The load of the library fails for the module
# anti.time, and the loader then reads the library for the name of the
# module, with the sixth allocation of the program. T139: memory that runs
# out there gives the reason of the system, where the program must stop.
name_memory alloc:6:ENOMEM
# The second open is the read of the library for the name of the module.
# When it fails the message is the reason of the system, which names the
# path of the library and the symbol it lacks.
name_unopened open:2:EACCES
